Z||000007||Alex4mula||01-25-2001||09:18 AM||||I used coparts to find parts for my 98 Vette project (not many in Junkyards). You deal directly with the yard. In my case I found what I needed with prompt shipment. Just call them & see how they treat you. If they have a web page that may indicate they do a lot of mail order business.||||reg||1
